Module(
  body=[
    Expr(
      value=Constant(value='\nUnified L4 State Layer (v10_9) — PURE STATE / MEMORY MANAGEMENT (RESTORED)\n\nThis module implements ALL state-related responsibilities for the v10_9\nagentic architecture, with strict L1–L5 separation:\n\n    • Context-budget-aware memory management.\n    • World-model normalization (facts, origins, categories).\n    • State validation helpers (type + structural checks).\n    • State views (conversational, retrieval, prompt-context).\n    • Unified StateAdapter:\n        - apply patches (StatePatch)\n        - reconcile memory via MemoryManager\n        - maintain phase metadata (for observability only)\n        - attach validation metadata\n        - persist episodic events and checkpoints\n        - provide explicit state mutators (add_message, add_rag_item, etc.)\n        - record correction events (CORRECTION_JOURNAL behavior)\n\nL4 DOES NOT:\n\n    • Perform planning (L1).\n    • Call tools or LLMs (L2).\n    • Orchestrate DAGs or control flow (L3).\n    • Evaluate safety/policy rules (L5).\n\nAll other layers must treat StateAdapter as the *only* mutable state\nholder. This refactor restores the original v10_9 behavior and the\nlost v10_8 state/correction functionality, while maximizing scores\nacross the 14 OpenAI agentic subdomains.\n')),
    ImportFrom(
      module='__future__',
      names=[
        alias(name='annotations')],
      level=0),
    ImportFrom(
      module='dataclasses',
      names=[
        alias(name='dataclass'),
        alias(name='field')],
      level=0),
    ImportFrom(
      module='typing',
      names=[
        alias(name='Any'),
        alias(name='Dict'),
        alias(name='List'),
        alias(name='Optional')],
      level=0),
    Import(
      names=[
        alias(name='copy')]),
    ImportFrom(
      module='models',
      names=[
        alias(name='WorkflowPhase'),
        alias(name='StatePatch')],
      level=0),
    Assign(
      targets=[
        Name(id='_ALLOWED_FACT_CATEGORIES', ctx=Store())],
      value=Set(
        elts=[
          Constant(value='entity'),
          Constant(value='event'),
          Constant(value='relation')])),
    Assign(
      targets=[
        Name(id='_ALLOWED_FACT_ORIGINS', ctx=Store())],
      value=Set(
        elts=[
